// Same `Explosion`->`GroundAoe` deviation as circle_of_death.ron next
// door, same reasoning (Explosion always self-centers, contradicts this
// spell's own 46m sheet range). Sheet's `aoe: Cone 9` normalized to a
// spherical `radius` per the sheet's own `notes` field ("Area normalized
// to a sphere zone") -- GroundAoe has no cone-shaped falloff either way.
//
// Damage retuned along the same hemoclysm.ron-anchored curve
// circle_of_death.ron uses, one circle higher (L8 vs L6): original 82 was
// barely above circle_of_death's own (then-)68, despite the 2-circle gap
// and despite already sitting below hemoclysm.ron itself (150 dmg at L7).
// Sheet's "constructs and the walking dead feel nothing of its grasp"
// creature-kind immunity rider dropped, same class of drop as
// negative_energy_flood.ron's own undead-immunity rider.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 200.0,
    buildup_duration: 1.0,
    delay: 0.55,
    recover_duration: 0.6,
    max_range: 46.0,
    radius: 9.0,
    min_falloff: 0.3,
    damage: 172,
    poise: 25,
    knockback: (strength: 10.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: Some(Purple),
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Necromancy),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        cooldown: Some(55.0),
        // level 8 spell -> min_level 48, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(48)),
    ),
)
